-----------------------------------------------------------------

* locking mechanisms

 * SCAN/DELETE -> only need the table to exist, lowest level lock
 * INSERT/UPDATE -> needs to be to exist and no concurrent index_build happenning
 * ADD/DROP_COLUMN/PARTITION/DROP_INDEX -> no concurrent same schema operation
 * INDEX_BUILD -> no concurrent schema change and no concurrent INSERT/UPDATE
 * DROP_TABLE -> fully eclusive lock

